  "description": "Procter & Gamble Hygiene and Health Care Limited (stock-exchange symbol PGHH) Annual Report 2025-26, the first report after the change, on the same definition as pghh-annual-report-2024-25-transition, covering the nine-month financial year from 1 July 2024 to 31 March 2025 between its July-June and April-March calendars, expressed with exceptions.history (fiscalclock 0.2.0). The transition's three quarters of three months, the quarters of the other years and the week block are illustrative: the reports print no quarter or week dates. year_number 'start' is consistent with the report (majority gives the same numbers for the years it states). Only fields this report states are asserted.",
  "source": {
    "kind": "cited",
    "citation": "\"The Board of Directors of the Company, on January 23, 2025, had approved the change in Financial Year of the Company from “July 1 – June 30” period to “April 1 – March 31” period. The Financial Year of the Company for period under review, viz., 2025-26, commenced on April 1, 2025, and ended on March 31, 2026.\" (Directors' Report, p. 9) \"*Previous Financial Year 2024-25 was a 9-month period from July 1, 2024, to March 31, 2025, and hence not comparable with current Financial Year 2025-26 (being 12-month Financial Year from April 1, 2025, to March 31, 2026).\" (p. 9) Establishes the bounds and the label 2025-26 of the first April to March year, and the bounds and the label 2024-25 of the nine-month year before it.",
